#: ../../config/options_advanced.rst:4
msgid ":index:`Advanced Options <configuration; advanced options>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../config/options_advanced.rst:6
msgid "This provides access to some of the advanced settings for Picard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../config/options_advanced.rst:19
msgid "**Include sub-folders when adding files from folder**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../config/options_advanced.rst:21
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled Picard will load all audio files in the selected "
"directory and all its subdirectories. If disabled only audio files in the "
"selected directory will be loaded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../config/options_advanced.rst:23
msgid "**Ignore hidden files**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../config/options_advanced.rst:25
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled then hidden files and directories will not be "
"loaded. This also includes any file or subdirectory inside a hidden "
"directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../config/options_advanced.rst:27
msgid "**Ignore file paths matching the following regular expression**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../config/options_advanced.rst:29
msgid ""
"You can specify patterns for files and directories that Picard should never "
"load. For example, if you set this to the regular expression ``\\.bak$`` any "
"file ending in \".bak\" will be ignored when loading files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../config/options_advanced.rst:31
msgid "**Test file path matching**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../config/options_advanced.rst:33
msgid ""
"This area allows you to enter file paths, one per line, to test your regular "
"expression. If a file path is marked in red, it does not match your regular "
"expression and will be loaded. A file path marked green matches your regular "
"expression and will not be loaded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../config/options_advanced.rst:37
msgid ""
"This list of test file paths will be cleared when you exit the configuration "
"section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../config/options_advanced.rst:45
msgid ""
"Details: :doc:`options_matching` / :doc:`options_sessions` / :doc:"
"`options_maintenance`"
msgstr ""
